  "body": "Two events A and B satisfy P(A and B) = 1/6 and P(B) = 1/2. Find P(A given B).",
  "options": ["1/3", "1/2", "2/3", "3/4"],
  "answer": 1,
  "explanation": "Use the definition P(A given B) = P(A and B) / P(B) = (1/6) / (1/2) = 1/3, which is option 1."
